<br class="ltx_break"><span id="S4.T1.5.4.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(e.g., turning on the light to locate the drawer)</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.5.5" class="ltx_tr">
