   <math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o_{\leq t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>o</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o_{\leq t}</annotation></semantics></math> — observation history up to <math id="alg1.l4.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>

