<span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">env</span><span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Environment setup and shutdown.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">skill_code</span><span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Contains all callable action implementations.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">video</span><span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Tools for simulation recording.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
<span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">object_positions</span><span id="A3.I3.i6.I1.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: For retrieving object location information.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
